<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>pirking</Major>
    <Description>It's a script for Russinan fishing 4 .Fishind with light pirking (pirkring) technique.
How to use: Just drop the bait at the depth you need and launch the script. 
The script checks is the fish on hook or not.
You do not need to use any specific resolution to use the script.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 150 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 90 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 280 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 3 s
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 90 ms
KeyUp 21 1
GoWhile 1 50</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Russian Fishing 4</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>